{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3a5c6935a3544b4db472177d696bfe3f","id":"pg_1e985737922f5c4faa8ded1500d1a411","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-mux-rs-docs-plans-2025-12-26-agent-test-tui-design-md-c2-ed1500d1a411.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_259db14cc1aa5379a07ee0c4ff184c61"],"title":"2389-research/mux-rs/docs/plans/2025-12-26-agent-test-tui-design.md @ c25c6c8e1acb","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3a5c6935a3544b4db472177d696bfe3f"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3a5c6935a3544b4db472177d696bfe3f","id":"pg_223c87b488745387b1c94609a2fa8599","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-mux-rs-readme-md-c25c6c8e1acb-4609a2fa8599.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_a163d826ada05b28ab8c28428922c537"],"title":"2389-research/mux-rs/README.md @ c25c6c8e1acb","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3a5c6935a3544b4db472177d696bfe3f"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_38c90e7fd5f690ddaa369fbddcc36a4eaf01f1ac52a4a715c60debcededc9466"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The planned LlmClient trait exposes async create_message returning a Response, and create_message_stream returning a pinned Stream of StreamEvent items (MessageStart, ContentBlockStart/Delta/Stop, MessageDelta, MessageStop)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6dfb632b798e53105c946cfc1ca7c8da04eb3373a557d80dafc78727f25c630f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The planned crate layout includes llm (types, client trait, anthropic, openai), tool (trait, registry, result), permission (policy, handler), mcp (types, client, proxy), an error module, and a mux-derive crate providing a #[derive(Tool)] proc macro."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b5c9a133cda55566609c70ef9b7cba45a22518933f3f6e2267cde60e812d27f7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Planned core dependencies are tokio (full features), serde with derive, serde_json, thiserror 2, anyhow, async-trait, reqwest 0.12 with json and stream features, futures 0.3, and glob 0.3, with tokio-test as a dev dependency."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b6f7d2b7c65052d89c6ae52db5792aa8d750fc1abd4288f25120448ecd383697"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The design doc records choices including a derive macro plus trait for tool definition, Tokio as async runtime, thiserror plus anyhow for errors, a policy engine for permissions, client-only MCP scope, and multi-provider LLM support (Anthropic and OpenAI)."}],"claim_ids":["clm_38c90e7fd5f690ddaa369fbddcc36a4eaf01f1ac52a4a715c60debcededc9466","clm_6dfb632b798e53105c946cfc1ca7c8da04eb3373a557d80dafc78727f25c630f","clm_b5c9a133cda55566609c70ef9b7cba45a22518933f3f6e2267cde60e812d27f7","clm_b6f7d2b7c65052d89c6ae52db5792aa8d750fc1abd4288f25120448ecd383697"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3a5c6935a3544b4db472177d696bfe3f","id":"pg_79edcbf128ba5049a9b3e3be2b551c7a","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-mux-rs-docs-plans-2025-12-25-mux-rs-design-md-c25c6c8e1a-e3be2b551c7a.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_33303493fc5f5f178642db7545656c50"],"title":"2389-research/mux-rs/docs/plans/2025-12-25-mux-rs-design.md @ c25c6c8e1acb","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3a5c6935a3544b4db472177d696bfe3f"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_49d2698042b1f93fbf7983eec6f760d9b373456068bafe1748fbb0aaf2d9ab22"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The planned client posts to https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages with x-api-key, anthropic-version (2023-06-01), and JSON content-type headers, mapping non-success statuses to LlmError::Api."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4d2913f676115c63175d7420003298bf0c2f4c4dcaf567f6aaaf7450faecf41b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A plan document specifies implementing an AnthropicClient that connects to the Claude API and implements the LlmClient trait."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6aa1c21faed7920792b2c1ec542a9cb66faba035de8b4ece1d73f24f1660f6aa"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The plan adds streaming support via an AnthropicStreamEvent enum (message start/stop, content block events, ping, error) and an async-stream based SSE parser that buffers chunks and splits on blank lines."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7dc00bede7df14b813e9673b2e68a8f05319076c6345221e4fa13bb536363452"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: each plan task prescribes verification via cargo check or cargo test, final clippy and cargo fmt runs, and a git commit per task with conventional-commit style messages."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a8a9f481a361e4db352e7be4578bbebd30f65180a428589d20b62cbd20b394a1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The planned Anthropic client architecture uses reqwest for HTTP with SSE streaming support, serializing the crate's Request type to Anthropic's format and deserializing responses back."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c5656c8867753e79d23267572efe2c7a826684f20a3351adeb58efef548705d4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The planned AnthropicRequest type carries model, messages, max_tokens, optional system and temperature, a tools list, and an optional stream flag, with optional fields skipped during serialization."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e347956f0a35de2f4c6ee0019230d1b3ac57e0caa4d8c39a259bee4c959289af"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the plan's header instructs the implementing Claude agent to use the superpowers:executing-plans skill to implement the plan task-by-task."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e7945a56905129521cee3b8cb1d35fb791c135df55b6e20731cb0a8040c3ab4b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The plan defines AnthropicClient::from_env, which reads the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY environment variable and returns an LlmError::Api error when it is unset."}],"claim_ids":["clm_49d2698042b1f93fbf7983eec6f760d9b373456068bafe1748fbb0aaf2d9ab22","clm_4d2913f676115c63175d7420003298bf0c2f4c4dcaf567f6aaaf7450faecf41b","clm_6aa1c21faed7920792b2c1ec542a9cb66faba035de8b4ece1d73f24f1660f6aa","clm_7dc00bede7df14b813e9673b2e68a8f05319076c6345221e4fa13bb536363452","clm_a8a9f481a361e4db352e7be4578bbebd30f65180a428589d20b62cbd20b394a1","clm_c5656c8867753e79d23267572efe2c7a826684f20a3351adeb58efef548705d4","clm_e347956f0a35de2f4c6ee0019230d1b3ac57e0caa4d8c39a259bee4c959289af","clm_e7945a56905129521cee3b8cb1d35fb791c135df55b6e20731cb0a8040c3ab4b"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3a5c6935a3544b4db472177d696bfe3f","id":"pg_a06af4fa677a5daeb4630e8d9bc8d583","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-mux-rs-docs-plans-2025-12-25-anthropic-client-md-c25c6c8-0e8d9bc8d583.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_6d32a3da1e275d7fa6d6701246ebc9d8"],"title":"2389-research/mux-rs/docs/plans/2025-12-25-anthropic-client.md @ c25c6c8e1acb","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3a5c6935a3544b4db472177d696bfe3f"}
